474	  img { display: block; width: auto; max-width: none; image-rendering: pixelated; }
475	  section.theme { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #232c39; }
476	</style>
477	</head>
478	<body>
479	  <h1>SVG exporter vs retired PNG renderer</h1>
480	  <p class="intro">
481	    Developer acceptance harness, not a CI gate. Each theme is exported from the retired PNG
482	    renderer and the current SVG renderer against the same deterministic --data fixture, both in
483	    Hack Nerd Font. The SVG is rasterized headlessly at ${DEVICE_SCALE_FACTOR}x scale (matching the
