/* flex-start rather than center: with a two-line label (a long option wraps, e.g. "Sign in via
   ohmyposh.dev"), centering the checkbox against the whole block floats it mid-text instead of
   next to the label's first line. The 0.15rem top offset nudges it back down to the first
